{"id":"actor","lemma":"actor","pos":"noun","rank":1670,"glosses":["actor (person who performs in a theatrical play or movie)"],"ipa":"/aɡˈtoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"actores","feminine":"actriz","femininePlural":"actrices"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-actor.wav","formAudio":{"actriz":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-actriz.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Tom es un actor?","en":"Is Tom an actor?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/262572"},{"text":"Los actores están acostumbrados a aparecer en público.","en":"Actors are used to appearing in public."},{"text":"Ella se hizo actriz.","en":"She became an actress.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461352"},{"text":"Vosotras sois actrices.","en":"You are actresses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/732253"},{"text":"Nunca quise ser actor.","en":"I never wanted to be an actor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731799"}]}